		{"id":"3dba17d697232820","x":-380,"y":-282,"width":1060,"height":4542,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TD\nA([Start SuperAgent]) --> D[Initialize SuperAgent and LangGraph thread]\nD --> E[Intent Analyzer <br> LLM extracts structured intent]\nE --> F{Confidence below 0.75 or if any clarification questions?}\nF -->|Yes| G[HITL: Intent checkpoint]\nG --> G1{Human provided correction?}\nG1 -->|Yes| E2[Update intent_feedback]\nE2 --> E\nG1 -->|No| H[Blueprint Generator]\nF -->|No| H[Blueprint Generator]\nH --> I{hitl required true or risk flags not empty}\nI -->|Yes| J[HITL: Blueprint checkpoint]\nJ --> J1{Human action}\nJ1 -->|Correction| J2[Update blueprint_feedback]\nJ2 --> H\nJ1 -->|Remove agent| K[Mutate blueprint agent list]\nK --> L[DAG Executor]\nJ1 -->|Approve| L[DAG Executor]\nI -->|No| L[DAG Executor]\nL --> L1[Group agents by parallel_group]\nL1 --> L2[For each group in order run agents concurrently]\nsubgraph M [Dynamic Agent Execution]\nM1[For each sub node run two Tavily searches]\nM2[LLM structured extraction per sub-node]\nM3[Merge sub-node outputs with agent merge prompt]\nM1 --> M2 --> M3\nend\nL2 --> M\nM --> N[Collect agent_outputs]\nN --> O[Critic finds conflicts gaps and confidence]\nO --> P{needs human review}\nP -->|Yes| Q[HITL: Critic checkpoint]\nQ --> Q1{Human added resolutions?}\nQ1 -->|Yes| Q2[Store hitl_override.conflict_resolutions]\nQ2 --> R[Final Synthesizer]\nQ1 -->|No| R[Final Synthesizer]\nP -->|No| R[Final Synthesizer]\nR --> R1[LLM composes markdown report]\nR1 --> R2[Write outputs idea_slug timestamp final_report.md]\nR2 --> S([End: return and print report path])\n```"}
